sequenceDiagram
    participant R1 as Request 1
    participant R2 as Request 2
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    R1->>DB: BEGIN
    R2->>DB: BEGIN

    R1->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (acquires row lock)
    DB-->>R1: available_seats = 1

    R2->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (blocks — row is locked)
    Note over R2,DB: Request 2 waits

    R1->>DB: UPDATE available_seats = 0
    R1->>DB: INSERT INTO bookings
    R1->>DB: COMMIT (releases lock)

    DB-->>R2: available_seats = 0 (lock acquired)
    R2->>DB: ROLLBACK
    Note over R2: NoSeatsAvailableException<br/>thrown by application code
